  "shortDescription": "Low-stock queue, reorder suggestions, supplier lead times and purchase proposals.",
  "longDescription": "A replenishment command center: stock health by SKU and warehouse, demand forecasts, supplier lead times, reorder rules, purchase proposals, approval routing and purchase orders with an admin panel for audit, imports, integrations and data quality.",
